<title>USA: MPM buys Skygas stake for 1.2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>MPM buys Skygas stake for 1.2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MPM Technologies Inc said that it has signed an agreement to acquire Unitel Technologies Inc 's 15 percent interest in its Skygas venture for 1.2 million share of common stock.</p>
<p>MPM said that it, along with venture partner USF Smogless SpA, is involved in the development and marketing of &quot;Skygas&quot;, a patented process for converting carbonaceous materials into clean-burning fuel gas, which can be used for electrical power generation or for conversion into a variety of chemicals.</p>
<p>USF Smogless is a subsidiary of U.S. Filter Corp.</p>
